	<element name="Wizard" type="Class" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_WOTC_PHB_CLASS_WIZARD">
		<description><p>Wizards are supreme magic-users, defined and united as a class by the spells they cast, drawn from a spellbook of arcane formulas.</p><p>Hit Dice: 1d6 per wizard level. Proficiencies: daggers, darts, slings, quarterstaffs, light crossbows. Saving throws: Intelligence, Wisdom. Skills: choose two from Arcana, History, Insight, Investigation, Medicine and Religion.</p></description>
