	<element name="Spellcasting" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_SPELLCASTING">
		<description><p>As a student of arcane magic, you have a spellbook containing spells. You prepare a number of wizard spells from your spellbook equal to your Intelligence modifier + your wizard level (minimum one). You can cast wizard spells as rituals if they are in your spellbook, and use an arcane focus.</p></description>
		<sheet><description>Prepare {{wizard:spellcasting:prepare}} spells from your spellbook.</description></sheet>
	</element>

	<element name="Arcane Recovery" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_ARCANE_RECOVERY">
		<description><p>Once per day when you finish a short rest, you can recover expended spell slots with a combined level equal to or less than half your wizard level (rounded up), none of 6th level or higher.</p></description>
		<sheet>
			<description usage="1/Long Rest">Recover spell slots totaling up to {{level:wizard:half:up}} levels during a short rest.</description>
		</sheet>
	</element>

