	<element name="Spell Mastery" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_SPELL_MASTERY">
		<description><p>Choose a 1st-level and a 2nd-level wizard spell in your spellbook. You can cast them at their lowest level without expending a spell slot when you have them prepared.</p></description>
