	<element name="Signature Spells" type="Class Feature" source="System Reference Document 5.1" id="ID_SRD_CLASS_FEATURE_WIZARD_SIGNATURE_SPELLS">
		<description><p>Choose two 3rd-level wizard spells in your spellbook as your signature spells. You always have them prepared, they don’t count against your prepared spells, and you can cast each once at 3rd level without a spell slot per short or long rest.</p></description>
		<rules>
